		//
		// Final-delivery escalation is identical to the nak path for the failure
		// index + alert: if a repo somehow races every delivery to exhaustion the
		// contention is no longer benign, so we record terminal (max_deliveries)
		// and label outcome=term — that DOES reach the alert. Fail open on the
		// index write exactly like dispositionNak.
		//
